{
  "job_B15.8.597_20251003_114347": {
    "text": "\u00d0is synd \u00fea land gem\u00e6r into Widiandune.\n\u00c6rest of anna forda innan tilno\u00fe andlang tilno\u00fees to waclescumbe.\nBetweoh wacles cumbe & ealdan sl\u00e6de innan m\u00e6nanlea.\nFram m\u00e6nanlea on horsweg.\nOf horswege innan gatanstige, \u00feanon innon denebroc.\nOf denebroce innon tilno\u00fe andlong tilno\u00fees to halgan wyllan.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re wyllan in hreodcumb \u00f0anon in \u00fea m\u00e6rdic andlang \u00fe\u00e6re dic to cnictes ferwege.\nOf \u00feam wege on ealdan stanwege, of stanwege on posecumbes heafdon.\nAnd swa on su\u00f0 healf \u00fe\u00e6s mores to wohan \u00e6c.\nFrom \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6c \u00feurh \u00feone sceagan on flod leah \u00feanon on beamweg.\nFrom \u00feam weg on buccan sl\u00e6d & swa eft on beanweg.\nAndlang \u00f0\u00e6s weges to colesburnan forda, from \u00feam forda innon cyrnea.\nAndlang ea to m\u00e6rcumbe, lang cumbes to lind ofres heafdan.\nAnd swa to \u00feam fulanwege to nataleahes \u00e6sce, fram \u00feam \u00e6sce to duddan heale.\nFram \u00feam heale andlang m\u00e6rweges to byrcsies heale, & swa to pican stapele.\nOf \u00feam stapule in catteshlinc, fram \u00feam hlince innan m\u00e6rbroc.\nAndlang broces to m\u00e6rforda, of \u00feam forda to sceapan \u00e6cge.\nAnd swa on \u00feone grenanweg, andlang weges to weallehes wege.\nAnd \u00feanon on stanihtan weg to alre wyllan, of alre wyllan to \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan dic.\nAndlang dic ofer huniburnan in \u00fea o\u00fere ealdan dic.\nAnd swa in \u00feone mylen pol, of \u00feam pole to \u00fe\u00e6re port str\u00e6te.\nAndlang str\u00e6te to \u00feam \u00feorne on annandune.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re dune into annan crundele, & swa \u00e6fter str\u00e6te in annanford.",
